# [DTN](../wg/dtn.html)

## Summary

The Delay-Tolerant Networking (DTN) Working Group held its first session (Session B, 1-hour duration) at IETF 127. The meeting was chaired by Edward Birrane and Rick Taylor. The session covered administrative updates, including welcoming new Area Director Jen Linkova and thanking outgoing Area Director Eric Klein. Technical presentations covered draft status updates across encapsulation, echo service, inter-domain routing, CoAP over BP, security contexts, EID patterns, convergence layers, neighborhood discovery, and YANG data models.

